//- The site's only typeface, loaded in one place. To swap fonts, change the
//- stylesheet URL and the --font-mono value below (nothing else references it).
//- Weights used: 400 (body) and 500 (name). Keep it monospaced: the decode effect
//- relies on every glyph having the same advance.
link(rel='preconnect' href='https://fonts.googleapis.com')
link(rel='preconnect' href='https://fonts.gstatic.com' crossorigin)
link(rel='stylesheet' href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap')
style.
  :root { --font-mono: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; }
